✔ employee-profile: a contract with no end date shows «غير محدد المدة» and computes no percentage (4316.835792ms)
✔ employee-profile: an employee can never read another employee’s profile, and the refusal names who to ask (4206.235791ms)
✔ employee-profile: a line manager sees work data but never a birth date, an age or a marital status (4049.636542ms)
✔ employee-profile: the personal record is version-checked, validated against its enumerations and append-only (4265.745125ms)
✔ NFR-08: migration 121 upgrades a pre-121 database without touching its rows, and applies once (5280.791875ms)
✔ employee-profile: the platform administrator reads no employee’s birth date, marital status, gender or nationality (4162.708208ms)
✔ employee-profile: the employee-records capability alone does not unlock gender and nationality (4298.120458ms)
✔ employee-profile: reading a colleague’s profile leaves an append-only record of who read it (4443.864542ms)
✔ employee-profile: the attendance-exemption reason reaches only the readers the attendance screen itself allows (4295.020542ms)
✔ employee-profile: an indefinite contract never borrows an end date from the employment record, and a clash is disclosed (8490.57175ms)
✔ employee-profile: a contract recorded as ended is not described as still running (4370.29625ms)
✔ employee-profile: a start date that has not arrived yet is said so, not reported as a missing date (4277.902458ms)
✔ employee-profile: the directory withholds gender and nationality by their own capability and names the column (4285.227125ms)
✔ employee-profile: the screen draws the contract badge, the hidden benefits and the Arabic count (4495.369083ms)
