✔ B1: an employee cannot list, open, approve, print or export a colleague's R11 snapshot, and its creator still can (4946.189166ms)
✔ B1/B2: the holder of executive.view sees and approves a manager's scoped snapshot; the creator cannot approve it (4135.658417ms)
✔ B1: a manager's department-scoped R07 snapshot reaches executive.view only, and an all-department snapshot never reaches a manager (4355.835917ms)
✔ B1: an R01 snapshot carrying the finance section stays with finance-cleared executives (4355.09375ms)
✔ B1: every report declares who may see a snapshot of it; only the client-team reports are creator-only (0.261625ms)
✔ B4: الرئيسية and ملخصي show the available leave days per type, with Arabic type names instead of codes (4107.97025ms)
✔ B5: ticking «اطلعت على نص هذه النسخة» sends confirm:true, and the server accepts the acknowledgement (4118.356ms)
✔ migration 096: notifications take a nullable request_id and a subject, and existing rows survive the rebuild (4287.369625ms)
✔ B7: request notifications carry the request title and outcome, the requester gets a receipt, and cancelling does not notify yourself (4308.72175ms)
✔ B6: leave decisions notify the employee in plain Arabic with the dates, and the next approver is told (4059.865292ms)
✔ B6: expense, custody, attendance-correction and letter decisions notify their owner, without amounts or identity numbers (4324.337833ms)
✔ B9: every missing required field is named in one message, with its keys in details (3.099041ms)
✔ B10: the activity record names every audit action the server writes, in both languages (3.754666ms)
✔ B13: the weekly timesheet hides approver tiles and blocks from someone who cannot approve (1.828625ms)
✔ B17: a pulse question opens with no answer chosen, so an untouched question cannot submit 1 (1.153959ms)
✔ B18: a note visible to the recipient’s manager stays with the manager of the day it was written (4066.188292ms)
✔ B19: one person cannot take both the manager step and the finance step on a claim (4262.446375ms)
✔ B22: counts read as Arabic, not as a number glued to a singular (0.372458ms)
✔ B22: the launcher, the catalog and the home screen use the shared helper (3.268209ms)
✔ B23/B24/B26/B34: the request page reads for its owner — «—» for optional, a reference, a time, and a real initial (3.704166ms)
✔ B27: money fields open a number keypad without changing their type or server rules (0.608ms)
✔ B28: the contract page links to the screens and services that exist (0.571708ms)
✔ S-01: the page links an icon and /favicon.ico is served, so no page load logs a 401 (6.399292ms)
✔ S-04: the catalog heading counts the same list the department rail counts (0.810792ms)
✔ S-08: the «اليوم» card writes dates the way the rest of the screen does (5.677125ms)
✔ S-07: a screen the server refuses offers a way back, not only a retry that changes nothing (1.67425ms)
✔ «طلباتي» carries the resignation, the travel decision and the benefit request, each read by its own module and nobody else’s (4137.799625ms)
✔ resignation and travel notify: a submit receipt, every decision, deemed acceptance, the last working day, travel approval and its extension (8696.821709ms)
✔ the benefit letter is generated, not recorded: it opens a real letter request and the employee downloads an issued document with its QR verification code (4155.513625ms)
✔ the discipline panel renders where the employee looks: on home when a case or a penalty exists, and never for someone with neither (4257.316167ms)
✔ an approved class upgrade changes the tier in the insurance register, with an audit line and a notice that the insurer must still be told (4129.202916ms)
✔ media contacts: an outside person is never recorded without a lawful basis, a source and a collection date, and the directory is closed to accounts without the capability and to other tenants (4146.759666ms)
✔ media list: the person who picked the list does not lock it, and a locked list is replaced rather than edited (4279.334958ms)
✔ pitches and coverage: the platform records a hand-sent pitch, a published pitch is final, coverage counts once per link with a human tone judgement, and the report invents no advertising value (4114.041ms)
✔ defaults: with no rows every user resolves to depth/dark, unlocked, source default — never auto (4264.538875ms)
✔ resolution order: personal choice, then company default, then depth/dark; reset returns to the company default (4249.012625ms)
✔ lock: the personal row is ignored but kept, the personal save is refused in clear Arabic, and the choice returns when the lock lifts (3966.041916ms)
✔ invalid values are refused: unknown design or theme, extra or missing keys, wrong types, short reason, stale version, no change (4148.020208ms)
✔ only the super admin sets the company default, inside a transaction, with a written reason — and every change is audited with before and after (4223.857375ms)
✔ tenant isolation: a company default, a lock and a personal choice in one tenant never reach the other (4111.33525ms)
