✔ F-03/F-04 HTTP: the procurement screen submits the package and finance reads and decides its own queue (5110.506125ms)
✔ PRC-01/03/04/05/06 and FIN-05/07/08: a purchase reaches two matched payables without payment or official issuance (4337.170458ms)
✔ PRC-01/03: allocation, comparison and evidence are required before an award (4277.156084ms)
✔ PRC-04/06: requesters cannot approve, skip an award, or match their own invoice (4466.754333ms)
✔ PRC-01 and FIN-02: project membership, current team and a separate PM cost grant constrain every read and action (4249.65025ms)
✔ PRC-04/05 and FIN-05: stale actions and repeated receipt or supplier invoice references create no second record (4448.015792ms)
✔ PRC-05/06: excess quantities, mismatched amounts and unmatched receipts cannot become payables (4387.234125ms)
✔ PRC-04/08 and PLT-06: submitted values, order versions and evidence records resist changes and deletion (4259.186792ms)
✔ PRC-01/04: decimal strings, bounds, currency and unrecognized fields are checked on the server (4373.333875ms)
✔ PRC-01 and PLT-09: creation retries return the current authorized record and rollback includes its audit (4645.212125ms)
✔ PRC-04 and PLT-06: public writes require a transaction and failed audit rolls back the submitted version (5176.710958ms)
✔ PRC-04/06: database constraints prevent an unbalanced payable and preserve receipt and invoice evidence (6083.48675ms)
✔ PRC-04: cancellation and rejection are final and cannot generate an internal order (4725.235333ms)
✔ PRC-01/04 UI: forms use authorized IDs, escape supplier evidence, and keep the opened version (4350.12475ms)
✔ PRC-02/03: an entity with no vendor file is refused at the quote and never reaches an internal order (4657.858916ms)
✔ PRC-05/06: whoever recorded a receipt cannot approve the match built on it, in code and in the database (4415.354667ms)
✔ production crew: the external freelancer is a vendor with a day rate, the internal employee is a user whose pay never appears here (4178.688375ms)
✔ talent release and location permit: a recorded fact and a producer decision, never a signature nor an assumed legal requirement (4125.310917ms)
✔ call sheet: the producer never issues their own sheet, and an issued sheet is replaced by a revision that states what changed (4072.5835ms)
✔ call sheet delivery: the platform notifies only people who hold an account, and it never claims to have reached anyone else (4212.194167ms)
✔ production lifecycle: the producer does not close their own production, a closed one is frozen, and stale versions and other tenants are refused (4209.177625ms)
✔ shoot schedule and shot list: the day keeps the order it was saved in, and a shot that changed state says why (4140.788583ms)
✔ production screens: every offered action opens a form, nothing is inlined past the strict CSP, and the screens say what they cannot do (4145.050167ms)
✔ المؤهل العلمي يرسل دون تاريخ انتهاء مصطنع، والهوية والجواز يظلان محميين (4204.555542ms)
✔ cost rates: the rate belongs to a job category and never to a person, its author never approves it, and an approved dated rate is final (4261.924375ms)
✔ profitability: every approved hour is valued at the rate in force on the date of that hour, not the rate in force today (4243.784167ms)
✔ profitability: unapproved hours and hours with no rate are declared, never silently valued at zero (4211.752708ms)
✔ profitability: overhead is loaded only from an approved dated rate, and its author never approves it (4039.428375ms)
✔ profitability: the forecast takes future commitments from outside this module and says plainly when it did not get them (4190.32225ms)
✔ profitability: every read is bounded by tenant and by its own capability, and service lines are tagged by a person, never guessed (4454.066917ms)
✔ profitability: category lifecycle is versioned and an inactive category cannot be priced or assigned (3937.571875ms)
✔ AXIS-01: the eight axes are independent — moving one leaves the other seven where they were (4429.9535ms)
✔ AXIS-02: the advance gate blocks paid execution and never touches pre-sale scoping (8718.87375ms)
