✔ timesheets: billable is the approver’s determination, and what the logger claimed is kept beside it rather than overwritten silently (6100.912291ms)
✔ timesheets: an approved week is closed to edits, additions and deletions, and the only correction is a later-week entry that points at the original (4177.927333ms)
